      "text": "arXiv:hep-th/9711057v2 30 Apr 1998 — 11 sections: Front matter; Introduction; Random-matrix theory for finite qu\n\n**arXiv:hep-th/9711057v2 30 Apr 1998**\n\n*T. Wilke1, T. Guhr1, and T. Wettig2*\n\n12 pp, 11 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Front matter; 1 Introduction; 2 Random-matrix theory for finite quark masses; 2.1 Formulation of the model; 2.2 Construction of orthogonal polynomials; 2.3 A duality of matrix ensembles; 3 Calculation of observables; 3.1 Microscopic spectral correlators and densi; 3.2 Distribution of the smallest eigenvalue; 4 Discussion; Acknowledgments",
